   "screen": "Types of processing files",
   "title": "Figure 1.7.3 · The grandfather–father–son backup principle",
   "alt": "Three master files in a row from left to right: grandfather (the oldest master), father, and son (the newest master). Between each pair is an update run. Transaction file 1 feeds the first update run, which combines it with the grandfather master to produce the father master. Transaction file 2 feeds the second update run, which combines it with the father master to produce the son master. A dashed arrow from the father to the son shows recovery: if the son is lost or damaged, run the father master with transaction file 2 again to recreate it. The grandfather is a further fallback.",
   "caption": "Three generations are kept so that a lost master file can always be rebuilt from the generation before it and its transaction file.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 380\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><defs><marker id=\"S1U7-3-ink\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0L10,5L0,10z\" class=\"f-ink\"/></marker><marker id=\"S1U7-3-ok\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0L10,5L0,10z\" class=\"f-ok\"/></marker></defs><path d=\"M20,150 H152 L170,168 V234 H20 Z\" class=\"f-surface s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M152,150 V168 H170\" class=\"f-none s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"190\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">GRANDFATHER</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"209\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">oldest master</text><path d=\"M245,150 H377 L395,168 V234 H245 Z\" class=\"f-surface s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M377,150 V168 H395\" class=\"f-none s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"190\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">FATHER</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"209\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">master</text><path d=\"M470,150 H602 L620,168 V234 H470 Z\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M602,150 V168 H620\" class=\"f-none s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"545\" y=\"190\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">SON</text><text x=\"545\" y=\"209\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">newest master</text><circle cx=\"207\" cy=\"192\" r=\"26\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"207\" y=\"188.7\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan x=\"207\">update</tspan><tspan x=\"207\" dy=\"15\">run</tspan></text><line x1=\"172\" y1=\"192\" x2=\"179\" y2=\"192\" class=\"s-ink\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#S1U7-3-ink)\"/><line x1=\"234\" y1=\"192\" x2=\"243\" y2=\"192\" class=\"s-ink\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#S1U7-3-ink)\"/><rect x=\"145\" y=\"40\" width=\"124\" height=\"56\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-surface s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"207\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">transaction</text><text x=\"207\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">file 1</text><line x1=\"207\" y1=\"96\" x2=\"207\" y2=\"164\" class=\"s-ink\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#S1U7-3-ink)\"/><circle cx=\"432\" cy=\"192\" r=\"26\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"432\" y=\"188.7\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan x=\"432\">update</tspan><tspan x=\"432\" dy=\"15\">run</tspan></text><line x1=\"397\" y1=\"192\" x2=\"404\" y2=\"192\" class=\"s-ink\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#S1U7-3-ink)\"/><line x1=\"459\" y1=\"192\" x2=\"468\" y2=\"192\" class=\"s-ink\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#S1U7-3-ink)\"/><rect x=\"370\" y=\"40\" width=\"124\" height=\"56\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-surface s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"432\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">transaction</text><text x=\"432\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">file 2</text><line x1=\"432\" y1=\"96\" x2=\"432\" y2=\"164\" class=\"s-ink\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#S1U7-3-ink)\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Each update run: old master + transactions → new master</text><path d=\"M320,238 C320,300 520,300 540,240\" class=\"f-none s-ok\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 4\" marker-end=\"url(#S1U7-3-ok)\"/><rect x=\"130\" y=\"300\" width=\"380\" height=\"64\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softok s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"324\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Son lost or damaged? Run the father master</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"344\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">with transaction file 2 again to recreate it.</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"270\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">a further</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"286\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">fallback</text></svg>"
