   "screen": "Mobile tech in emergencies and telemedicine",
   "title": "Figure 2.3.2 · Remote monitoring by phone",
   "alt": "At home, a patient uses a glucose meter or blood pressure cuff showing a reading of 7.9. The device passes the reading to a phone, which sends the readings to the clinic system. The clinic system stores and checks each reading; a dangerous one raises an alert to the doctor. A dashed arrow from the doctor back to the patient's home shows a video consultation or call back. Limits listed below: it needs a reliable connection, the patient needs a device and skills, medical data must stay private, and some conditions need an examination in person.",
   "caption": "The patient never leaves home, yet the clinic sees every reading. That matters on small islands where some specialists do not live locally.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 340\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><defs><marker id=\"S2U3-2-bad\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0L10,5L0,10z\" class=\"f-bad\"/></marker><marker id=\"S2U3-2-gold\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0L10,5L0,10z\" class=\"f-gold\"/></marker><marker id=\"S2U3-2-ink\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0L10,5L0,10z\" class=\"f-ink\"/></marker><marker id=\"S2U3-2-ok\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0L10,5L0,10z\" class=\"f-ok\"/></marker></defs><text x=\"320\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Remote monitoring: telemedicine at work</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"40\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" rx=\"12\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M30,90 L110,52 L190,90\" class=\"f-none s-muted\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"110\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">At home</text><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"154.4\" r=\"9.1\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M44.4,190.8 Q44.4,167.4 60,167.4 Q75.6,167.4 75.6,190.8 Z\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"96\" y=\"150\" width=\"44\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" class=\"f-softb s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"169.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">7.9</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"198\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">glucose meter or</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"214\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">blood pressure cuff</text><rect x=\"163\" y=\"150\" width=\"18\" height=\"32\" rx=\"3\" class=\"f-softb s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"169\" y1=\"178\" x2=\"175\" y2=\"178\" class=\"s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"142\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"158\" y2=\"160\" class=\"s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#S2U3-2-ink)\"/><line x1=\"214\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"292\" y2=\"140\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#S2U3-2-gold)\"/><text x=\"253\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">readings</text><text x=\"253\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">via the</text><text x=\"253\" y=\"176\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">phone</text><rect x=\"296\" y=\"40\" width=\"160\" height=\"200\" rx=\"12\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"376\" y=\"64\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Clinic system</text><path d=\"M349,91 V141 A27,9 0 0 0 403,141 V91\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><ellipse cx=\"376\" cy=\"91\" rx=\"27\" ry=\"9\" class=\"f-surface s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"376\" y=\"168\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">checks each reading</text><rect x=\"316\" y=\"182\" width=\"120\" height=\"40\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softbad s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"376\" y=\"206.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">ALERT: danger!</text><line x1=\"458\" y1=\"202\" x2=\"506\" y2=\"202\" class=\"s-bad\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#S2U3-2-bad)\"/><circle cx=\"552\" cy=\"174.4\" r=\"9.1\" class=\"f-softok s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M536.4,210.8 Q536.4,187.4 552,187.4 Q567.6,187.4 567.6,210.8 Z\" class=\"f-softok s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"552\" y=\"228\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">doctor</text><path d=\"M552,160 C552,30 110,20 110,50\" class=\"f-none s-ok\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\" marker-end=\"url(#S2U3-2-ok)\"/><text x=\"520\" y=\"82\" font-size=\"13\">video consultation</text><text x=\"520\" y=\"98\" font-size=\"13\">or call back</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"270\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Limits:</text><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"266\" r=\"3\" class=\"f-bad s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"90\" y=\"270\" font-size=\"13\">needs a reliable connection</text><circle cx=\"360\" cy=\"266\" r=\"3\" class=\"f-bad s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"370\" y=\"270\" font-size=\"13\">patient needs a device and skills</text><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"290\" r=\"3\" class=\"f-bad s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"90\" y=\"294\" font-size=\"13\">medical data must stay private</text><circle cx=\"360\" cy=\"290\" r=\"3\" class=\"f-bad s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"370\" y=\"294\" font-size=\"13\">some conditions need an exam in person</text></svg>"
