   "alt": "The same Eco Club page shown on two devices. On a laptop, the page has a full menu bar (Home, About, Events, Contact) and three columns side by side. On a phone, the three columns stack into one column and the menu collapses into a three-line menu icon. A note says to watch for sideways scrolling, tiny text, cramped buttons and wide tables.",
