  {
   "screen": "When formulas go wrong: error values",
   "title": "Figure 5.2.3 · Spreadsheet error values and their causes",
   "alt": "Six error values, each with an example, its cause and a fix. #DIV/0!: =B2/C2 when C2 is 0; dividing by zero or an empty cell; check the divisor. #NAME?: =SUMM(B2:B5); a misspelt function, or text without quotation marks; fix the spelling or add quotes. #VALUE!: =B2+A2 where A2 holds the word ten; the wrong type of data, such as adding text; find the text in a number column. #REF!: =B2*#REF!; a cell the formula used was deleted; undo with Ctrl+Z or rewrite. #N/A: =VLOOKUP(\"P205\",…); the lookup value is not in the table; check spelling and spaces. #####: a big number in a narrow column; widen the column. Bottom: the worst errors show no # at all; =B2+C2+D2/3 gives a believable but wrong average, so always check a few results by hand.",
   "caption": "Each error value points to a different cause, so read it before you start fixing.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 400\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><text x=\"20\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Read the error value, find the cause</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"38\" width=\"608\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"16\" y=\"38\" width=\"110\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softbad s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"71\" y=\"66.2\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"monospace\">#DIV/0!</text><text x=\"138\" y=\"57\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"monospace\">=B2/C2 when C2 is 0</text><text x=\"138\" y=\"75\" font-size=\"12\" class=\"f-muted\">dividing by zero or an empty cell</text><text x=\"612\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"700\">check the divisor</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"90\" width=\"608\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"16\" y=\"90\" width=\"110\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softbad s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"71\" y=\"118.2\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"monospace\">#NAME?</text><text x=\"138\" y=\"109\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"monospace\">=SUMM(B2:B5)</text><text x=\"138\" y=\"127\" font-size=\"12\" class=\"f-muted\">misspelt function, or text without &quot;quotes&quot;</text><text x=\"612\" y=\"118\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"700\">fix the spelling or add quotes</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"142\" width=\"608\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"16\" y=\"142\" width=\"110\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softbad s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"71\" y=\"170.2\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"monospace\">#VALUE!</text><text x=\"138\" y=\"161\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"monospace\">=B2+A2 (A2 holds &quot;ten&quot;)</text><text x=\"138\" y=\"179\" font-size=\"12\" class=\"f-muted\">wrong type of data, e.g. adding text</text><text x=\"612\" y=\"170\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"700\">find text in a number column</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"194\" width=\"608\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"16\" y=\"194\" width=\"110\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softbad s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"71\" y=\"222.2\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"monospace\">#REF!</text><text x=\"138\" y=\"213\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"monospace\">=B2*#REF!</text><text x=\"138\" y=\"231\" font-size=\"12\" class=\"f-muted\">a cell the formula used was deleted</text><text x=\"612\" y=\"222\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"700\">undo (Ctrl+Z) or rewrite</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"246\" width=\"608\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"16\" y=\"246\" width=\"110\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softbad s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"71\" y=\"274.2\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"monospace\">#N/A</text><text x=\"138\" y=\"265\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"monospace\">=VLOOKUP(&quot;P205&quot;,…)</text><text x=\"138\" y=\"283\" font-size=\"12\" class=\"f-muted\">lookup value not in the table</text><text x=\"612\" y=\"274\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"700\">check spelling and spaces</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"298\" width=\"608\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"16\" y=\"298\" width=\"110\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softbad s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"71\" y=\"326.2\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"monospace\">#####</text><text x=\"138\" y=\"317\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"monospace\">big number, narrow column</text><text x=\"138\" y=\"335\" font-size=\"12\" class=\"f-muted\">column too narrow</text><text x=\"612\" y=\"326\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"700\">widen the column</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"368\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">The worst errors show no # at all: =B2+C2+D2/3 gives a believable but wrong average.</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"388\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Always check a few results by hand.</text></svg>"
  }
