   "screen": "Data types: choose the right one",
   "title": "Figure 6.1.2 · A decision key for data types",
   "alt": "A chain of questions. Only two possible answers? If yes, Yes/No (logical), for example Returned or InStock. If no: is it a date or a time? If yes, Date/Time, for example DateOut or DateDue. If no: is it money? If yes, Currency, for example Price or Fine. If no: will you do arithmetic with it? If yes, Number, for example Pages or Age. If no: more than 255 characters? If yes, Long Text, for example notes or comments. If no, Short Text: names, IDs such as B001, and phone numbers, which are never used in sums and may have dashes or a leading 0.",
   "caption": "A phone number fails the arithmetic question, so it is Short Text, not Number. Give the reason as well as the type for full marks.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 476\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><defs><marker id=\"S6U1-2-ink\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0L10,5L0,10z\" class=\"f-ink\"/></marker><marker id=\"S6U1-2-ok\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0L10,5L0,10z\" class=\"f-ok\"/></marker></defs><text x=\"20\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Choosing a data type: ask these questions in order</text><polygon points=\"170,42 318,70 170,98 22,70\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"67.6\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\"><tspan x=\"170\">Only two possible</tspan><tspan x=\"170\" dy=\"13.2\">answers?</tspan></text><line x1=\"318\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"70\" class=\"s-ok\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#S6U1-2-ok)\"/><text x=\"342\" y=\"64\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Yes</text><rect x=\"372\" y=\"48\" width=\"252\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softok s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"386\" y=\"68\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Yes/No (logical)</text><text x=\"386\" y=\"85\" font-size=\"12\" class=\"f-muted\">e.g. Returned, InStock</text><line x1=\"170\" y1=\"98\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"114\" class=\"s-ink\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#S6U1-2-ink)\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"111\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"700\">No</text><polygon points=\"170,114 318,142 170,170 22,142\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"139.6\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\"><tspan x=\"170\">Is it a date or</tspan><tspan x=\"170\" dy=\"13.2\">a time?</tspan></text><line x1=\"318\" y1=\"142\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"142\" class=\"s-ok\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#S6U1-2-ok)\"/><text x=\"342\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Yes</text><rect x=\"372\" y=\"120\" width=\"252\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softok s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"386\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Date/Time</text><text x=\"386\" y=\"157\" font-size=\"12\" class=\"f-muted\">e.g. DateOut, DateDue</text><line x1=\"170\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"186\" class=\"s-ink\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#S6U1-2-ink)\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"183\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"700\">No</text><polygon points=\"170,186 318,214 170,242 22,214\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"218.2\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Is it money?</text><line x1=\"318\" y1=\"214\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"214\" class=\"s-ok\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#S6U1-2-ok)\"/><text x=\"342\" y=\"208\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Yes</text><rect x=\"372\" y=\"192\" width=\"252\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softok s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"386\" y=\"212\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Currency</text><text x=\"386\" y=\"229\" font-size=\"12\" class=\"f-muted\">e.g. Price, Fine</text><line x1=\"170\" y1=\"242\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"258\" class=\"s-ink\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#S6U1-2-ink)\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"255\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"700\">No</text><polygon points=\"170,258 318,286 170,314 22,286\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"283.6\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\"><tspan x=\"170\">Will you do arithmetic</tspan><tspan x=\"170\" dy=\"13.2\">with it?</tspan></text><line x1=\"318\" y1=\"286\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"286\" class=\"s-ok\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#S6U1-2-ok)\"/><text x=\"342\" y=\"280\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Yes</text><rect x=\"372\" y=\"264\" width=\"252\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softok s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"386\" y=\"284\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Number</text><text x=\"386\" y=\"301\" font-size=\"12\" class=\"f-muted\">e.g. Pages, Age</text><line x1=\"170\" y1=\"314\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"330\" class=\"s-ink\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#S6U1-2-ink)\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"327\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"700\">No</text><polygon points=\"170,330 318,358 170,386 22,358\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"355.6\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\"><tspan x=\"170\">More than 255</tspan><tspan x=\"170\" dy=\"13.2\">characters?</tspan></text><line x1=\"318\" y1=\"358\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"358\" class=\"s-ok\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#S6U1-2-ok)\"/><text x=\"342\" y=\"352\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Yes</text><rect x=\"372\" y=\"336\" width=\"252\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softok s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"386\" y=\"356\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Long Text</text><text x=\"386\" y=\"373\" font-size=\"12\" class=\"f-muted\">e.g. notes, comments</text><line x1=\"170\" y1=\"386\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"402\" class=\"s-ink\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#S6U1-2-ink)\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"700\">No</text><rect x=\"70\" y=\"406\" width=\"200\" height=\"40\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"430.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Short Text</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"422\" font-size=\"12\">names, IDs such as B001, and phone numbers:</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"438\" font-size=\"12\">never used in sums; may have dashes or a leading 0</text></svg>"
