  {
   "screen": "Reports: information ready to present",
   "title": "Figure 6.4.3 · From tables to a finished report",
   "alt": "Three tables, tblMember, tblBook and tblLoan, feed a query that joins the tables and filters the records. The query feeds the Report Wizard, whose steps are: 1, tables and fields; 2, grouping levels; 3, sort order and Summary Options; 4, layout and orientation; 5, title and preview. The report can be output to Print Preview on screen, to a printer with File then Print, or to a PDF file to e-mail. Why a report rather than a printed table: only the fields you need, neatly laid out; fields from several tables through a query, and only matching records; grouping and sorting with counts, totals and averages; titles, logos, dates and page numbers; and it is read-only, so data cannot be edited.",
   "caption": "For the SBA, build and check the query first, then run the Report Wizard on the query.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 360\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><defs><marker id=\"S6U4-3-gold\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0L10,5L0,10z\" class=\"f-gold\"/></marker><marker id=\"S6U4-3-ink\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0L10,5L0,10z\" class=\"f-ink\"/></marker></defs><text x=\"20\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">From tables to a finished report</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"44\" width=\"120\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"76\" y=\"70.5\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"monospace\">tblMember</text><path d=\"M138,66 C160,66 160,128 178,128\" class=\"f-none s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#S6U4-3-ink)\"/><rect x=\"16\" y=\"100\" width=\"120\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"76\" y=\"126.5\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"monospace\">tblBook</text><path d=\"M138,122 C160,122 160,128 178,128\" class=\"f-none s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#S6U4-3-ink)\"/><rect x=\"16\" y=\"156\" width=\"120\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"76\" y=\"182.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"monospace\">tblLoan</text><path d=\"M138,178 C160,178 160,128 178,128\" class=\"f-none s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#S6U4-3-ink)\"/><rect x=\"182\" y=\"96\" width=\"120\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"242\" y=\"116.3\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Query</text><text x=\"242\" y=\"132.8\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\"><tspan x=\"242\">joins tables;</tspan><tspan x=\"242\" dy=\"16.2\">filters records</tspan></text><line x1=\"304\" y1=\"128\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"128\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#S6U4-3-gold)\"/><rect x=\"334\" y=\"40\" width=\"140\" height=\"176\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"404\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Report Wizard</text><text x=\"346\" y=\"88\" font-size=\"12\">1 tables / fields</text><text x=\"346\" y=\"114\" font-size=\"12\">2 grouping levels</text><text x=\"346\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"12\">3 sort + Summary</text><text x=\"346\" y=\"166\" font-size=\"12\">4 layout + orientation</text><text x=\"346\" y=\"192\" font-size=\"12\">5 title + preview</text><line x1=\"476\" y1=\"128\" x2=\"500\" y2=\"128\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#S6U4-3-gold)\"/><rect x=\"504\" y=\"44\" width=\"120\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softok s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"564\" y=\"64\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Print Preview</text><text x=\"564\" y=\"82\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">on screen</text><rect x=\"504\" y=\"102\" width=\"120\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softok s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"564\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Printer</text><text x=\"564\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">File ▸ Print</text><rect x=\"504\" y=\"160\" width=\"120\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softok s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"564\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">PDF file</text><text x=\"564\" y=\"198\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">to e-mail</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"236\" width=\"608\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"260\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Why a report, not a printed table?</text><circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"278\" r=\"3.5\" class=\"f-gold s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"46\" y=\"283\" font-size=\"12\">only the fields you need, neatly laid out</text><circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"296\" r=\"3.5\" class=\"f-gold s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"46\" y=\"301\" font-size=\"12\">fields from several tables (via a query); only matching records</text><circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"314\" r=\"3.5\" class=\"f-gold s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"46\" y=\"319\" font-size=\"12\">grouped and sorted, with counts, totals and averages</text><circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"332\" r=\"3.5\" class=\"f-gold s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"46\" y=\"337\" font-size=\"12\">titles, logos, dates, page numbers; read-only: data cannot be edited</text></svg>"
  }
