  {
   "screen": "Counters, accumulators, highest and lowest",
   "title": "Figure 7.3.3 · Rainfall: total, average, highest and a counter",
   "alt": "A bar chart of seven days of rainfall in millimetres: 12, 0, 35, 22, 8, 41 and 15. A dashed line marks 20 mm; the three bars above it (35, 22 and 41) are highlighted, and the tallest, 41, is labelled highest. Four boxes show the patterns: accumulator, total ← total + rain, giving Total: 133; average, total / 7 calculated after the loop, giving Average: 19; highest so far, IF rain > highest THEN, giving Highest: 41; counter inside an IF, IF rain > 20 add 1 to wetDays, giving Days over 20 mm: 3.",
   "caption": "One pass through the data can do all four jobs at once. Only the average waits until after the loop.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 400\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><text x=\"20\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Rainfall for 7 days (mm): four patterns in one loop</text><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"270\" x2=\"508\" y2=\"270\" class=\"s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"178\" x2=\"508\" y2=\"178\" class=\"s-bad\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/><text x=\"512\" y=\"182\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\">20 mm</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"214.8\" width=\"52\" height=\"55.2\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-softb s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"86\" y=\"208.8\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">12</text><text x=\"86\" y=\"288\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">day 1</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"264\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">0</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"288\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">day 2</text><rect x=\"188\" y=\"109\" width=\"52\" height=\"161\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-softbad s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"214\" y=\"103\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">35</text><text x=\"214\" y=\"288\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">day 3</text><rect x=\"252\" y=\"168.8\" width=\"52\" height=\"101.2\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-softbad s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"278\" y=\"162.8\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">22</text><text x=\"278\" y=\"288\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">day 4</text><rect x=\"316\" y=\"233.2\" width=\"52\" height=\"36.8\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-softb s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"342\" y=\"227.2\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">8</text><text x=\"342\" y=\"288\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">day 5</text><rect x=\"380\" y=\"81.4\" width=\"52\" height=\"188.6\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-gold s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"406\" y=\"75.4\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">41</text><text x=\"406\" y=\"288\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">day 6</text><rect x=\"444\" y=\"201\" width=\"52\" height=\"69\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-softb s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"470\" y=\"195\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">15</text><text x=\"470\" y=\"288\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">day 7</text><text x=\"406\" y=\"59.4\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">highest</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"300\" width=\"146\" height=\"88\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"89\" y=\"320\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Accumulator</text><text x=\"89\" y=\"342\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">total ← total + rain</text><text x=\"89\" y=\"372\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Total: 133</text><rect x=\"170\" y=\"300\" width=\"146\" height=\"88\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"243\" y=\"320\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Average</text><text x=\"243\" y=\"342\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">total / 7 AFTER the loop</text><text x=\"243\" y=\"372\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Average: 19</text><rect x=\"324\" y=\"300\" width=\"146\" height=\"88\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"397\" y=\"320\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Highest so far</text><text x=\"397\" y=\"342\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">IF rain &gt; highest</text><text x=\"397\" y=\"372\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Highest: 41</text><rect x=\"478\" y=\"300\" width=\"146\" height=\"88\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"551\" y=\"320\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Counter in an IF</text><text x=\"551\" y=\"342\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">IF rain &gt; 20: add 1</text><text x=\"551\" y=\"372\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Days over 20 mm: 3</text></svg>"
  }
