  {
   "screen": "Maintenance: the step that never ends",
   "title": "Figure 8.2.3 · Corrective, adaptive and perfective maintenance",
   "alt": "Three kinds of maintenance lead to a change in the program. Corrective: fix bugs found after release, for example a stock program that crashes when a quantity reaches zero. Adaptive: make it suit a changed environment, for example a new tax rate, or a move from PCs to tablets. Perfective: improve speed or add features, for example a ferry booking program that adds a seat map. After every change: re-test everything, including tests that passed before; if a test fails, change the program again; then it goes back into use. Good documentation makes every change safer.",
   "caption": "Maintenance is often the longest and most expensive stage of a program's life. Ask why the change is needed: to fix, to adapt or to improve.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 380\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><defs><marker id=\"S8U2-3-ink\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0L10,5L0,10z\" class=\"f-ink\"/></marker><marker id=\"S8U2-3-ok\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0L10,5L0,10z\" class=\"f-ok\"/></marker></defs><text x=\"20\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Three reasons to maintain a program, and the step after every change</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"38\" width=\"196\" height=\"118\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-surface s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"114\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Corrective</text><text x=\"114\" y=\"89.3\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan x=\"114\">fix bugs found</tspan><tspan x=\"114\" dy=\"13.8\">after release</tspan></text><text x=\"114\" y=\"129.3\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\"><tspan x=\"114\">e.g. stock program crashes</tspan><tspan x=\"114\" dy=\"13.8\">when quantity hits 0</tspan></text><path d=\"M114,158 V176 H320 V190\" class=\"f-none s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><rect x=\"222\" y=\"38\" width=\"196\" height=\"118\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-surface s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Adaptive</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"89.3\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan x=\"320\">suit a changed</tspan><tspan x=\"320\" dy=\"13.8\">environment</tspan></text><text x=\"320\" y=\"129.3\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\"><tspan x=\"320\">e.g. new tax rate; move</tspan><tspan x=\"320\" dy=\"13.8\">from PCs to tablets</tspan></text><path d=\"M320,158 V176 H320 V190\" class=\"f-none s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><rect x=\"428\" y=\"38\" width=\"196\" height=\"118\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-surface s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"526\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Perfective</text><text x=\"526\" y=\"89.3\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan x=\"526\">improve speed or</tspan><tspan x=\"526\" dy=\"13.8\">add features</tspan></text><text x=\"526\" y=\"129.3\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\"><tspan x=\"526\">e.g. ferry booking adds</tspan><tspan x=\"526\" dy=\"13.8\">a seat map</tspan></text><path d=\"M526,158 V176 H320 V190\" class=\"f-none s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><line x1=\"320\" y1=\"188\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"200\" class=\"s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#S8U2-3-ink)\"/><rect x=\"220\" y=\"202\" width=\"200\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"228.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Change the program</text><line x1=\"320\" y1=\"248\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"268\" class=\"s-ink\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#S8U2-3-ink)\"/><rect x=\"190\" y=\"270\" width=\"260\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softok s-ok\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"290.1\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Re-test everything,</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"306.4\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">including tests that passed before</text><path d=\"M450,294 H560 V224 H424\" class=\"f-none s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\" marker-end=\"url(#S8U2-3-ok)\"/><text x=\"566\" y=\"260\" font-size=\"12\" class=\"f-muted\">fails?</text><line x1=\"320\" y1=\"320\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"340\" class=\"s-ink\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#S8U2-3-ink)\"/><rect x=\"240\" y=\"342\" width=\"160\" height=\"30\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"361.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Back in use</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"344\" font-size=\"12\" class=\"f-muted\">Good documentation makes</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"360\" font-size=\"12\" class=\"f-muted\">every change safer.</text></svg>"
  }
