   "screen": "Searching an array",
   "title": "Figure 8.4.2 · Linear search and binary search",
   "alt": "Top, linear search for 123 in the array 1334, 4354, 5465, 123, 5676 with subscripts 1 to 5. Each element is compared in turn: 1334 no, 4354 no, 5465 no, 123 yes. Found at subscript 4 after 4 comparisons; 5676 is not checked. Bottom, binary search for 5465 in the sorted array 123, 1334, 4354, 5465, 5676. Step 1: the middle element is 4354, which is too small, so keep the upper half. Step 2: the lower half is crossed out; the middle of what is left is 5465: found. Found in 2 comparisons, because each step throws away half of what is left.",
   "caption": "Linear search works on any list but may check every element. Binary search is much faster but only works on a sorted list.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 420\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><defs><marker id=\"S8U4-2-gold\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0L10,5L0,10z\" class=\"f-gold\"/></marker></defs><text x=\"20\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Linear search for 123: check each element in turn</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"50\" width=\"88\" height=\"44\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-softbad s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"104\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"monospace\">1334</text><text x=\"104\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">[1]</text><text x=\"104\" y=\"134\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">= 123? No</text><rect x=\"160\" y=\"50\" width=\"88\" height=\"44\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-softbad s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"204\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"monospace\">4354</text><text x=\"204\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">[2]</text><text x=\"204\" y=\"134\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">= 123? No</text><rect x=\"260\" y=\"50\" width=\"88\" height=\"44\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-softbad s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"304\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"monospace\">5465</text><text x=\"304\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">[3]</text><text x=\"304\" y=\"134\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">= 123? No</text><rect x=\"360\" y=\"50\" width=\"88\" height=\"44\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-softok s-ok\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"404\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"monospace\">123</text><text x=\"404\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">[4]</text><text x=\"404\" y=\"134\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">= 123? Yes</text><rect x=\"460\" y=\"50\" width=\"88\" height=\"44\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"504\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"monospace\">5676</text><text x=\"504\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">[5]</text><path d=\"M120,40 q24,-14 48,0\" class=\"f-none s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#S8U4-2-gold)\"/><path d=\"M220,40 q24,-14 48,0\" class=\"f-none s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#S8U4-2-gold)\"/><path d=\"M320,40 q24,-14 48,0\" class=\"f-none s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#S8U4-2-gold)\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Found at subscript 4 after 4 comparisons</text><text x=\"560\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">not checked</text><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"630\" y2=\"180\" class=\"s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"206\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Binary search for 5465: the array must be SORTED</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"254\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Step 1</text><rect x=\"110\" y=\"226\" width=\"80\" height=\"40\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"252\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"monospace\">123</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"226\" width=\"80\" height=\"40\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"240\" y=\"252\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"monospace\">1334</text><rect x=\"290\" y=\"226\" width=\"80\" height=\"40\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"330\" y=\"252\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"monospace\">4354</text><rect x=\"380\" y=\"226\" width=\"80\" height=\"40\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"420\" y=\"252\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"monospace\">5465</text><rect x=\"470\" y=\"226\" width=\"80\" height=\"40\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"510\" y=\"252\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"monospace\">5676</text><text x=\"560\" y=\"224\" font-size=\"12\">middle = 4354</text><text x=\"560\" y=\"242\" font-size=\"12\">too small: keep</text><text x=\"560\" y=\"260\" font-size=\"12\">the upper half</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"344\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Step 2</text><rect x=\"110\" y=\"316\" width=\"80\" height=\"40\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-none s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"342\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\" font-family=\"monospace\">123</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"316\" width=\"80\" height=\"40\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-none s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"240\" y=\"342\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\" font-family=\"monospace\">1334</text><rect x=\"290\" y=\"316\" width=\"80\" height=\"40\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-none s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"330\" y=\"342\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\" font-family=\"monospace\">4354</text><rect x=\"380\" y=\"316\" width=\"80\" height=\"40\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-softok s-ok\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"420\" y=\"342\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"monospace\">5465</text><rect x=\"470\" y=\"316\" width=\"80\" height=\"40\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"510\" y=\"342\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"monospace\">5676</text><text x=\"552\" y=\"332\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\">middle = 5465:</text><text x=\"552\" y=\"350\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\">found!</text><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"336\" x2=\"370\" y2=\"336\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"410\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Found in 2 comparisons: each step throws away half of what is left.</text></svg>"
