   "screen": "External documentation: the user manual",
   "title": "Figure 8.5.2 · What goes in a user manual and a technical manual",
   "alt": "Two manuals side by side. The user manual, for the user and written without jargon, contains: what the program is for; hardware and software needed; how to install and start it; step-by-step instructions with screenshots; what each input means and its valid values; what the output means; and error messages and what to do about them. The technical manual, for programmers, contains: the problem statement; the algorithm as pseudocode and/or a flowchart; a variable list with data types; the program listing; test data and results; and known limitations.",
   "caption": "Match the manual to its reader: users need to know what to do; programmers need to know how it works.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 400\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><text x=\"20\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Two kinds of external manual, two different readers</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"36\" width=\"296\" height=\"270\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-surface s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"16\" y=\"36\" width=\"14\" height=\"270\" rx=\"3\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"171\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">User manual</text><text x=\"44\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\">1.</text><text x=\"62\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"12\">What the program is for</text><text x=\"44\" y=\"114\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\">2.</text><text x=\"62\" y=\"114\" font-size=\"12\">Hardware and software needed</text><text x=\"44\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\">3.</text><text x=\"62\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"12\">How to install and start it</text><text x=\"44\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\">4.</text><text x=\"62\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"12\">Step-by-step instructions</text><text x=\"62\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"12\">(with screenshots)</text><text x=\"44\" y=\"204\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\">5.</text><text x=\"62\" y=\"204\" font-size=\"12\">What each input means</text><text x=\"62\" y=\"222\" font-size=\"12\">and its valid values</text><text x=\"44\" y=\"246\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\">6.</text><text x=\"62\" y=\"246\" font-size=\"12\">What the output means</text><text x=\"44\" y=\"270\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\">7.</text><text x=\"62\" y=\"270\" font-size=\"12\">Error messages and what</text><text x=\"62\" y=\"288\" font-size=\"12\">to do about them</text><circle cx=\"282\" cy=\"326\" r=\"7\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M270,354 Q270,336 282,336 Q294,336 294,354 Z\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"262\" y=\"344\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"700\">for the USER: no jargon</text><rect x=\"328\" y=\"36\" width=\"296\" height=\"270\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-surface s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"328\" y=\"36\" width=\"14\" height=\"270\" rx=\"3\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"483\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Technical manual</text><text x=\"356\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\">1.</text><text x=\"374\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"12\">Problem statement</text><text x=\"356\" y=\"114\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\">2.</text><text x=\"374\" y=\"114\" font-size=\"12\">Algorithm: pseudocode</text><text x=\"374\" y=\"132\" font-size=\"12\">and/or flowchart</text><text x=\"356\" y=\"156\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\">3.</text><text x=\"374\" y=\"156\" font-size=\"12\">Variable list with data types</text><text x=\"356\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\">4.</text><text x=\"374\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"12\">Program listing</text><text x=\"356\" y=\"204\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\">5.</text><text x=\"374\" y=\"204\" font-size=\"12\">Test data and results</text><text x=\"356\" y=\"228\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\">6.</text><text x=\"374\" y=\"228\" font-size=\"12\">Known limitations</text><circle cx=\"594\" cy=\"326\" r=\"7\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M582,354 Q582,336 594,336 Q606,336 606,354 Z\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"574\" y=\"344\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"700\">for PROGRAMMERS</text></svg>"
