   "screen": "Flowchart ← code: working backwards",
   "title": "Figure 8.6.1 · Converting code into a flowchart",
   "alt": "Left, the Sunrise Bakery Python fragment, one statement per line: total = 0; for i in range(1, 6):; price = float(input()); total = total + price; print(total). Dotted lines link each line to its flowchart symbol on the right. Start terminator. total ← 0 becomes a process rectangle. The for loop becomes a decision diamond, i <= 5?, with i starting at 1. The input becomes a parallelogram, Read price. The assignment becomes a rectangle, total ← total + price, followed by i ← i + 1 and an arrow looping back to the diamond. When the answer is No, the flow goes to the output parallelogram, Write total, then the Stop terminator. A note: range(1, 6) means i = 1 TO 5.",
   "caption": "Inputs and outputs become parallelograms, assignments become rectangles, and loops and IFs become diamonds. Watch for off-by-one errors when translating range().",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 440\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><defs><marker id=\"S8U6-1-ink\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0L10,5L0,10z\" class=\"f-ink\"/></marker></defs><text x=\"20\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Working backwards: each statement becomes one flowchart symbol</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"36\" width=\"260\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-softb s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\">Python (Sunrise Bakery)</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"80\" width=\"260\" height=\"30\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"monospace\">total = 0</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"140\" width=\"260\" height=\"30\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"monospace\">for i in range(1, 6):</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"212\" width=\"260\" height=\"30\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"232\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"monospace\">  price = float(input())</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"272\" width=\"260\" height=\"30\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"292\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"monospace\">  total = total + price</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"364\" width=\"260\" height=\"30\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"384\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"monospace\">print(total)</text><rect x=\"420\" y=\"35\" width=\"100\" height=\"30\" rx=\"15\" class=\"f-softok s-ok\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"470\" y=\"54.5\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Start</text><rect x=\"395\" y=\"79\" width=\"150\" height=\"34\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-surface s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"470\" y=\"100.5\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">total ← 0</text><polygon points=\"470,132 555,160 470,188 385,160\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"470\" y=\"157.6\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan x=\"470\">i &lt;= 5 ?</tspan><tspan x=\"470\" dy=\"13.2\">(i starts at 1)</tspan></text><polygon points=\"405,211 555,211 535,245 385,245\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"470\" y=\"232.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Read price</text><rect x=\"375\" y=\"271\" width=\"190\" height=\"34\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-surface s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"470\" y=\"292.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">total ← total + price</text><rect x=\"415\" y=\"320\" width=\"110\" height=\"28\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-surface s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"470\" y=\"338.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">i ← i + 1</text><polygon points=\"405,363 555,363 535,397 385,397\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"470\" y=\"384.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Write total</text><rect x=\"420\" y=\"409\" width=\"100\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" class=\"f-softok s-ok\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"470\" y=\"426.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Stop</text><line x1=\"470\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"470\" y2=\"79\" class=\"s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#S8U6-1-ink)\"/><line x1=\"470\" y1=\"113\" x2=\"470\" y2=\"132\" class=\"s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#S8U6-1-ink)\"/><line x1=\"470\" y1=\"188\" x2=\"470\" y2=\"211\" class=\"s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#S8U6-1-ink)\"/><line x1=\"470\" y1=\"245\" x2=\"470\" y2=\"271\" class=\"s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#S8U6-1-ink)\"/><line x1=\"470\" y1=\"305\" x2=\"470\" y2=\"320\" class=\"s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#S8U6-1-ink)\"/><line x1=\"470\" y1=\"397\" x2=\"470\" y2=\"409\" class=\"s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#S8U6-1-ink)\"/><path d=\"M415,334 H360 V160 H383\" class=\"f-none s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#S8U6-1-ink)\"/><path d=\"M555,160 H610 V362 H472\" class=\"f-none s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#S8U6-1-ink)\"/><text x=\"462\" y=\"206\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"700\">Yes</text><text x=\"562\" y=\"152\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\">No</text><line x1=\"278\" y1=\"96\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"96\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><line x1=\"278\" y1=\"156\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"156\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><line x1=\"278\" y1=\"228\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"228\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><line x1=\"278\" y1=\"288\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"288\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><line x1=\"278\" y1=\"380\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"380\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><text x=\"318\" y=\"170\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">loop</text><text x=\"146\" y=\"432\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">range(1, 6) means i = 1 TO 5</text></svg>"
