   "alt": "The same algorithm sits at the centre, with seven parts of the beach clean-up project around it, each with its best language. Pascal or Python: the SBA weigh-in program. VBA: the results spreadsheet. JavaScript: the live total on the website. Python: ten years of data and graphs. C or C++: the firmware in the scale. Java or Kotlin: the volunteers' Android phone app. Blocks: teaching Form 1. Choose by platform, speed, portability, skills, cost and maintenance; for the SBA, use your centre's language.",
